# The client's lockfile IS committed, deliberately. gonogo's Uplink clients have
# none of their own and lean on the workspace lockfile, so an extracted client
# floats every transitive version and meets breakage the monorepo never sees.
# `uplink-extraction-debt.mjs` explicitly declines to count a missing lockfile,
# which is what let that stay invisible.
